@startuml
title Site Footer Component
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "SiteFooter.tsx" as SiteFooter
component "site-footer.css" as Styles
component "HomePage" as HomePage

HomePage --> SiteFooter : renders persistent footer
SiteFooter --> Styles : class contract

note right of SiteFooter
Footer copy is safe public context.
Private origin details, phone numbers,
and deployment details do not belong here.
end note

@enduml
